  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till att st&#xe4;rka medborgares engagemenag f&#xf6;r ansvarsutkr&#xe4;vande    genom att &#xf6;ka tillg&#xe5;ng till information i stor skala genom innovativa metoder. S&#xe4;rskild inriktning p&#xe5; ansvarsutkr&#xe4;vande inom sektorerna     utbildning, vatten och h&#xe4;lsa.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to strengthen citizen agency and action for demanding         accountability through increasing access to information in large      scale through innovative methods. Special focus on accountability in  the sectors: education, water and health.</narrative>
  </description>
